    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[冬天脚后跟干裂，小腿长“鱼鳞”？还真不是你皮肤缺水！]]></title>
      <description><![CDATA[<img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vXUelfKjHMjRTv5Y6DgU8ITKEibkibORldkAFD7icJ6TORYv7TRTn0xUrJibf4aJDgOn2W2mrVtm6JXyjibhFbSMyo7gW8483fIUDWiaibaMBwTFVA/300?wxtype=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=0"/><p>每到秋冬，我的身体都会发出干燥警报：脱下秋裤，皮屑如雪花般飘落；脚后跟又厚又硬，粗糙得经常勾到袜子；手上的倒刺反复长，一撕就流血，疼得钻心；手肘、膝盖处干硬发白，有时还有小裂口......图源：图虫创</p>]]></description>
      <link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTg1MjI3MzY2MQ==&amp;mid=2652381234&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=2715fc9261791c55b72ba493b47d3ab2&amp;chksm=5c28c87248d44358f40924064d5f845c87b57057f99c60b212c15db6e2383770dde7fe4599df&amp;scene=0&amp;xtrack=1#rd</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
    </item>
